  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n[#reload](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#reload) will synchronously fire an assert, regardless of if there are ongoing events or method trackers. This should be able to be fixed in a similar manner as #11409, and should be considered in #11579.",
